# Prisma UUID Rules

- Every table PK: `id String @id @default(uuid(7)) @db.Uuid`
- Every FK column: `@db.Uuid` matching referenced PK type
- Never use `@default(cuid())` or autoincrement for domain tables
- Seed data only via Prisma Client (uuid(7) is client-generated)
